ng Villas is ideally situated for exploring the best of Canggu. Whether you seek relaxation or adventure, Pulang Villas offers the perfect base for an unforgettable vacation.</p>\r\n<div class=\"info-location mt-3\">\r\n<div class=\"row ms-1 mb-3 pb-3 border-bottom \">\r\n<div class=\"col-2\">\r\n<i class=\"ic-beach\"></i>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-10\">10 minutes walk to Pererenan Beach</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row ms-1 mb-3 pb-3 border-bottom \">\r\n<div class=\"col-2\">\r\n<i class=\"ic-temple\"></i>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-10\">25 minutes drive to Tanah Lot Temple</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row ms-1 mb-3\">\r\n<div class=\"col-2\">\r\n<i class=\"ic-plane\"></i>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-10\">60 minutes drive to Airport</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>','no'),(475,'_options_location','field_6464468b4ff54','no'),(476,'options_google_map','<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d15777.920480423565!2d115.1250163!3d-8.6458028!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x2dd239007bc5ea1d%3A0x4a24a78c7d6bfd67!2sVilla%20Pulang%20by%20Nakula!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sid!4v1723083343420!5m2!1sen!2sid\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>','no'),(477,'_options_google_map','field_646446974ff55','no'),(478,'options_instagram','','no'),(479,'_options_instagram','field_646446a94ff56','no'),(480,'options_footer_info_1','<h6 class=\"mt-40\">Address</h6>\r\nJl. Pantai Pererenan No.116, Pererenan, Mengwi, Badung\r\n\r\nPhone <a href=\"tel:+62361738999\">+62 361-738-999</a>\r\nWhatsApp <a class=\"inter\" href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=%2b6282145811275 &amp;text=Hi,%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20the%20Pulang%20villa%20by%20Nakula,%20Is%20it%20available?.\">+62 821-4581-1275</a> (text only)','no'),(481,'_options_footer_info_1','field_646446ba4ff57','no'),(482,'options_footer_info_2','<h6 class=\"fw-light\">General Enquiries:</h6>\r\n<a 