\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(254,263,'collage_image_1','257'),(255,263,'_collage_image_1','field_6465cc9b04cbb'),(256,263,'collage_image_2','258'),(257,263,'_collage_image_2','field_6465ccb504cbc'),(258,263,'collage_image_3','259'),(259,263,'_collage_image_3','field_6465ccbb04cbd'),(260,263,'collage_image_4','262'),(261,263,'_collage_image_4','field_6465ccc004cbe'),(262,263,'collage_image_5','261'),(263,263,'_collage_image_5','field_6465ccc904cbf'),(264,263,'collage_content_1',''),(265,263,'_collage_content_1','field_6465cec18ad32'),(266,263,'collage_content_2',''),(267,263,'_collage_content_2','field_6465cec98ad33'),(268,263,'features_image_1',''),(269,263,'_features_image_1','field_6465ced28ad34'),(270,263,'features_image_2',''),(271,263,'_features_image_2','field_6465ceee8ad35'),(272,263,'features_image_3',''),(273,263,'_features_image_3','field_6465cf5cfb457'),(274,264,'collage_image_1','257'),(275,264,'_collage_image_1','field_6465cc9b04cbb'),(276,264,'collage_image_2','258'),(277,264,'_collage_image_2','field_6465ccb504cbc'),(278,264,'collage_image_3','259'),(279,264,'_collage_image_3','field_6465ccbb04cbd'),(280,264,'collage_image_4','262'),(281,264,'_collage_image_4','field_6465ccc004cbe'),(282,264,'collage_image_5','261'),(283,264,'_collage_image_5','field_6465ccc904cbf'),(284,264,'collage_content_1','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pulang Villas was initially designed as a vacation home, with interiors and design elements that reflect the owner\'s personal taste. Each villa features unique artwork and puzzle paintings created by the owner\'s children, adding a personal and creative touch to the luxurious ambiance. These thoughtful design elements, combined with modern amenities, ensure a harmonious getaway for every guest.</span></p>'),(285,264,'_collage_content_1','field_6465cec18ad32'),(286,264,'collage_content_2','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The name \"Pulang,\" meaning \"home\" in Indonesian, perfectly captures the warm, welcoming atmosphere we intend for our guests to experience. From the beautifully landscaped gardens to the inviting living spaces, every detail of Pulang Villas is designed to make you feel at home. Whether you\'re relaxing by the private overflow pool, enjoying the spacious living areas, or exploring the local attractions, Pulang Villas offers the ideal setting for a memorable stay.</span></p>'),(287,264,'_collage_content_2','field_6465cec98ad33'),(288,264,'features_image_1',''),(289,264,'_features_image_1','field_6465ced28ad34'),(290,264,'features_image_2',''),(291,264,'_features_image_2','field_6465ceee8ad35'),(292,264,'features_image_3',''),(293,264,'_features_image_3','field_6465cf5cfb457'),(294,29,'quick_facts','<table class=\"table\">\r\n<tbody><!--<tr>\r\n<td>Property Area</td>\r\n<td>500m²</td>\r\n</tr>-->\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Jl. Pantai Pererenan No.116, Pererenan, Mengwi, Badung Regency</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Capacity</td>\r\n<td>6 People</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<!--<tr>\r\n<td>Living Areas</td>\r\n<td>Spacious living area and exclusive access to 500 m² of the villa\'s facilities and common areas</td>\r\n</tr>-->\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Pool</td>\r\n<td>7m x 3m x 1,5m</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Entertainment</td>\r\n<td>TV Available 1 in living area</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Staff</td>\r\n<td>Rest easy with an attentive and hospitable team at your service. Butler, Concierge, housekeeping and service staff. Additional staff (nanny/babysitter, masseuse) available on request at extra charge.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Breakfast</td>\r\n<td>English or Indonesian breakfast service is available from 7 - 11 AM</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Dining</td>\r\n<td>Cooks are available to prepare and serve meals at the villa at an extra charge (Service fee &amp; groceries)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Communication</td>\r\n<td>Complimentary WiFi in all areas of the villa</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>In Room Amenities</td>\r\n<td>Hairdryers, Shampoo, Conditioner, Shower Gel, Smart Television, Wardrobe</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>For Families</td>\r\n<td>Fully equipped kitchen, Butler Service</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Safety &amp; Security</td>\r\n<td>First-aid kit, fire extinguishers and safe boxes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Airport Transport</td>\r\n<td>Possible to be arranged with your villa manager at small cost</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Daily Transport</td>\r\n<td>One car and driver for up to 8 hours per day. (extra cost)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Additional Facilities</td>\r\n<td>Massage beds; barbecue; available upon request (extra cost)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Restriction</td>\r\n<td>Strictly no Pets Allowed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>'),(295,29,'_quick_facts','field_6465d966ea46f'),(296,29,'villa_description','<p>The fully equipped kitchens and elegant dining areas, decorated with natural wooden tones, provide the perfect space for preparing and enjoying meals with loved ones. Guests can also enjoy complimentary WiFi and a daily English breakfast served from 8:00 AM to 10:00 AM, adding to the convenience and comfort of their stay</p>'),(297,29,'_villa_description','field_6465e0caee48c'),(298,29,'villa_image','3'),(299,29,'_villa_image','field_6465e63767cd3'),(300,29,'facilities_homepage',''),(301,29,'_facilities_homepage','field_6466f20df7cd1'),(302,29,'availability',''),(303,29,'_availability','field_64671d240fb40'),(304,29,'rates',''),(305,29,'_rates','field_64671d480fb41'),(306,29,'reviews','1'),(307,29,'_reviews','field_64671b8e80efb'),(308,29,'slide','0'),(309,29,'_slide','field_65685b33e32be'),(310,266,'quick_facts',''),(311,266,'_quick_facts','field_6465d966ea46f'),(312,266,'villa_description','The f