ld_66b4332288300'),(627,327,'quick_facts','<table class=\"table\">\r\n<tbody><!--<tr>\r\n<td>Property Area</td>\r\n<td>500m²</td>\r\n</tr>-->\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Jl. Pantai Pererenan No.116, Pererenan, Mengwi, Badung Regency</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Capacity</td>\r\n<td>6 People</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<!--<tr>\r\n<td>Living Areas</td>\r\n<td>Spacious living area and exclusive access to 500 m² of the villa\'s facilities and common areas</td>\r\n</tr>-->\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Pool</td>\r\n<td>7m x 3m x 1,5m</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Entertainment</td>\r\n<td>Available 1 in living area</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Staff</td>\r\n<td>Rest easy with an attentive and hospitable team at your service. Butler, Concierge, housekeeping and service staff. Additional staff (nanny/babysitter, masseuse) available on request at extra charge.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Breakfast</td>\r\n<td>English or Indonesian breakfast service is available from 7 - 11 AM</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Dining</td>\r\n<td>Cooks are available to prepare and serve meals at the villa at an extra charge (Service fee &amp; groceries)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Communication</td>\r\n<td>Complimentary WiFi in all areas of the villa</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>In Room Amenities</td>\r\n<td>Hairdryers, Shampoo, Conditioner, Shower Gel, Smart Television, Wardrobe</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>For Families</td>\r\n<td>Fully equipped kitchen, Butler Service</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Safety &amp; Security</td>\r\n<td>First-aid kit, fire extinguishers and safe boxes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Airport Transport</td>\r\n<td>Possible to be arranged with your villa manager at small cost</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Daily Transport</td>\r\n<td>One car and driver for up to 8 hours per day. (extra cost)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Additional Facilities</td>\r\n<td>Massage beds; barbecue; available upon request (extra cost)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Restriction</td>\r\n<td>Strictly no Pets Allowed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>'),(628,327,'_quick_facts','field_6465d966ea46f'),(629,327,'villa_description','<p>The fully equipped kitchens and elegant dining areas, decorated with natural wooden tones, provide the perfect space for preparing and enjoying meals with loved ones. Guests can also enjoy complimentary WiFi and a daily English breakfast served from 8:00 AM to 10:00 AM, adding to the convenience and comfort of their stay</p>'),(630,327,'_villa_description','field_6465e0caee48c'),(631,327,'villa_image_0_image','278'),(632,327,'_villa_image_0_image','field_6465e65267cd4'),(633,327,'villa_image_1_image','279'),(634,327,'_villa_image_1_image','field_6465e65267cd4'),(635,327,'villa_image_2_image','280'),(636,327,'_villa_image_2_image','field_6465e65267cd4'),(637,327,'villa_image','3'),(638,327,'_villa_image','field_6465e63767cd3'),(639,327,'facilities_homepage',''),(640,327,'_facilities_homepage','field_6466f20df7cd1'),(641,327,'availability',''),(642,327,'_availability','field_64671d240fb40'),(643,327,'rates',''),(644,327,'_rates','field_64671d480fb41'),(645,327,'reviews','0'),(646,327,'_reviews','field_64671b8e80efb'),(647,327,'slide','0'),(648,327,'_slide','field_65685b33e32be'),(649,328,'image_bg','277'),(650,328,'_image_bg','field_66b4332288300'),(651,328,'quick_facts','<table class=\"table\">\r\n<tbody><!--<tr>\r\n<td>Property Area</td>\r\n<td>500m²</td>\r\n</tr>-->\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Jl. Pantai Pererenan No.116, Pererenan, Mengwi, Badung Regency</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Capacity</td>\r\n<td>6 People</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<!--<tr>\r\n<td>Living Areas</td>\r\n<td>Spacious living area and exclusive access to 500 m² of the villa\'s facilities and common areas</td>\r\n</tr>-->\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Pool</td>\r\n<td>7m x 3m x 1,5m</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Entertainment</td>\r\n<td>TV Available 1 in living area</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Staff</td>\r\n<td>Rest easy with an attentive and hospitable team at your service. Butler, Concierge, ho