\r\n<td>First-aid kit, fire extinguishers and safe boxes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Airport Transport</td>\r\n<td>Possible to be arranged with your villa manager at small cost</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Daily Transport</td>\r\n<td>One car and driver for up to 8 hours per day. (extra cost)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Additional Facilities</td>\r\n<td>Massage beds; barbecue; available upon request (extra cost)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Restriction</td>\r\n<td>Strictly no Pets Allowed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>'),(749,343,'_quick_facts','field_6465d966ea46f'),(750,343,'villa_description','The three bedroom villa includes an enclosed living room, kitchen and dining areas, perfect for both relaxation and entertaining. Upstairs, you will find an additional large family room if you need some private time. It is set in a peaceful riverside location with tall trees. Step outside to enjoy a large outdoor swimming pool, complete with a pool deck, lounge chairs and a beautifully landscaped garden, offering a serene space to unwind.'),(751,343,'_villa_description','field_6465e0caee48c'),(752,343,'villa_image','14'),(753,343,'_villa_image','field_6465e63767cd3'),(754,343,'facilities_homepage','<div class=\"col d-flex align-items-start mb-3\"><i class=\"ic-size flex-shrink-0 me-3\"></i>\r\n<div>380 m2</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col d-flex align-items-start mb-3\"><i class=\"ic-wifi flex-shrink-0 me-3\"></i>\r\n<div>Free WiFi</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col d-flex align-items-start mb-3\"><i class=\"ic-pool flex-shrink-0 me-3\"></i>\r\n<div>Private Pool</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col d-flex align-items-start mb-3\"><i class=\"ic-coffee flex-shrink-0 me-3\"></i>\r\n<div>Breakfast Included</div>\r\n</div>'),(755,343,'_facilities_homepage','field_6466f20df7cd1'),(756,343,'availability',''),(757,343,'_availability','field_64671d240fb40'),(758,343,'rates',''),(759,343,'_rates','field_64671d480fb41'),(760,343,'reviews','0'),(761,343,'_reviews','field_6467