 These thoughtful design elements, combined with modern amenities, ensure a harmonious getaway for every guest.</span></p>'),(1172,438,'_collage_content_1','field_6465cec18ad32'),(1173,438,'collage_content_2','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The name \"Pulang,\" meaning \"home\" in Indonesian, perfectly captures the warm, welcoming atmosphere we intend for our guests to experience. From the beautifully landscaped gardens to the inviting living spaces, every detail of Pulang Villas is designed to make you feel at home. Whether you\'re relaxing by the private overflow pool, enjoying the spacious living areas, or exploring the local attractions, Pulang Villas offers the ideal setting for a memorable stay.</span></p>'),(1174,438,'_collage_content_2','field_6465cec98ad33'),(1175,438,'features_image_1',''),(1176,438,'_features_image_1','field_6465ced28ad34'),(1177,438,'features_image_2',''),(1178,438,'_features_image_2','field_6465ceee8ad35'),(1179,438,'features_image_3',''),(1180,438,'_features_image_3','field_6465cf5cfb457'),(1185,441,'main_offer','<h3>Nyepi Package</h3>\r\n<p>Take a deep breath, slow down, and embrace the beauty of Nyepi at Pulang Villas, a tranquil hideaway in Pererenan, Bali. Here, time moves gently, the air feels lighter, and the world grows quieter—giving you the perfect space to rest, reflect, and recharge.</p>\r\n<p><a class=\"btn btn-outline-red rounded-0 me-3\" href=\"https://pulangbali.com/nyepi-package\">See Detail</a></p>'),(1186,441,'_main_offer','field_64673c2a10690'),(1187,441,'image_offer_1','394'),(1188,441,'_image_offer_1','field_64673c4310691'),(1189,441,'offer_multiple_0_text_offer','<h3>Eid Escape at Pulang Villas – A Tranquil Celebration in Pererenan</h3>\r\n<p>Escape the bustle and embrace the beauty of Eid al-Fitr in the tranquil setting of Pulang Villas. Tucked away in Pererenan, this intimate retreat is designed for those who seek a balance of privacy, comfort, and effortless island charm—a place to celebrate, reflect, and