,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/DINING-min.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(299,1,'2024-08-08 06:55:55','2024-08-08 06:55:55','','indoor','','inherit','open','closed','','dining-kitchen-and-living-area-min','','','2024-08-08 07:03:16','2024-08-08 07:03:16','',34,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/DINING-KITCHEN-AND-LIVING-AREA-min.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(300,1,'2024-08-08 06:55:55','2024-08-08 06:55:55','','indoor','','inherit','open','closed','','dining-kitchen-min','','','2024-08-08 07:03:25','2024-08-08 07:03:25','',34,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/DINING-KITCHEN-min.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(301,1,'2024-08-08 06:57:15','2024-08-08 06:57:15','','Gallery','','inherit','closed','closed','','34-revision-v1','','','2024-08-08 06:57:15','2024-08-08 06:57:15','',34,'https://pulangbali.com/?p=301',0,'revision','',0),(302,1,'2024-08-09 05:58:57','2024-08-09 05:58:57','','Logo Nakula White','','inherit','open','closed','','logo-nakula-white','','','2024-08-09 05:58:57','2024-08-09 05:58:57','',0,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Logo-Nakula-White.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(303,1,'2024-08-09 05:59:17','2024-08-09 05:59:17','','favicon','','inherit','open','closed','','favicon','','','2024-08-09 05:59:17','2024-08-09 05:59:17','',0,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/favicon.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(304,1,'2024-08-13 04:00:10','2024-08-13 04:00:10','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Indulge in the royal treatment during your stay with our #WelcomeHome treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our dedicated team of butlers and concierge professionals are available around the clock to cater to your every need. Whether it\'s making reservations or providing recommendations for local attractions in Pererenan, our experts are here to ensure you have a seamless and unforgettable experience. While our butler service operates for 8 hours a day, our villa manager and butler are available 24/7 for any assistance you may require. Sit back, relax, and allow us to take care of all your needs as providing exceptional hospitality is our utmost priority.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Butler &amp; Concierge','','publish','closed','closed','','butler-concierge','','','2024-08-13 04:00:10','2024-08-13 04:00:10','',0,'https://pulangbali.com/?post_type=highlight&#038;p=304',0,'highlight','',0),(305,1,'2024-08-13 04:00:02','2024-08-13 04:00:02','','butler-concierge (1)','','inherit','open','closed','','butler-concierge-1','','','2024-08-13 04:00:02','2024-08-13 04:00:02','',304,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/butler-concierge-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(306,1,'2024-08-13 04:07:00','2024-08-13 04:07:00','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Get ready to tantalize your taste buds with the In-Villa Dining experience!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Enjoy a home cooked feast in the comfort of your villa while our talented chefs prepare a menu of culinary delights, from local fishes’ delicacies to meats dishes. Indulge in scrumptious barbecues, regional specialties, and more without having to pay for costly restaurant meals. With In-Villa Dining, you can enjoy delicious meals without ever leaving your luxury home-away-from-home. Inform our team to reserve your menu.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','In-Villa Dining','','publish','closed','closed','','in-villa-dining','','','2024-08-13 04:07:00','2024-08-13 04:07:00','',0,'https://pulangbali.com/?post_type=highlight&#038;p=306',0,'highlight','',0),(307,1,'2024-08-13 04:02:45','2024-08-13 04:02:45','','exp-in-villa-dining (1)','','inherit','open','closed','','exp-in-villa-dining-1','','','2024-08-13 04:02:45','2024-08-13 04:02:45','',306,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/exp-in-villa-dining-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(309,1,'2024-08-13 04:11:48','2024-08-13 04:11:48','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Rejuvenate your senses with a variety of holistic activities offered at our villa. From yoga sessions to spa treatments that soothe the soul, every aspect of your stay is crafted to elevate your well-being.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To ensure an intimate and personalized experience, we offer booking by request. Simply book one day prior to ensure that our therapist is available on that day. Your journey to wellness begins with a simple request.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Wellness','','publish','closed','closed','','wellness','','','2024-08-13 04:11:48','2024-08-13 04:11:48','',0,'https://pulangbali.com/?post_type=highlight&#038;p=309',0,'highlight','',0),(310,1,'2024-08-13 04:11:26','2024-08-13 04:11:26','','exp-healthy-wellness (1)','','inherit','open','closed','','exp-healthy-wellness-1','','','2024-08-13 04:11:26','2024-08-13 04:11:26','',309,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/exp-healthy-wellness-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(311,1,'2024-08-13 04:13:40','2024-08-13 04:13:40','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Looking for the most interesting Pererenan activities? Take a look at Activities by Nakula. Our exciting and one-of-a-kind experiences will make your stay in the area unforgettable. We suggest all from yoga to surfing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reserve now and allow us to assist you in creating memories that will last a lifetime.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Activities','','publish','closed','closed','','activities','','','2024-08-13 04:13:40','2024-08-13 04:13:40','',0,'https://pulangbali.com/?post_type=highlight&#038;p=311',0,'highlight','',0),(312,1,'2024-08-13 04:13:22','2024-08-13 04:13:22','','exp-activities (2)','','inherit','open','closed','','exp-activities-2','','','2024-08-13 04:13:22','2024-08-13 04:13:22','',311,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/exp-activities-2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(313,1,'2024-08-13 04:15:13','2024-08-13 04:15:13','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You don’t have to go far to start exploring! When you stay at Villa Pulang, we provide several recommendations for destinations that you can visit. From beaches, beach club to hidden gems, explore the beauty of nature in all its glory.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Destination Guide &amp; Highlights','','publish','closed','closed','','destination-guide-highlights','','','2024-08-13 04:15:17','2024-08-13 04:15:17','',0,'https://pulangbali.com/?post_type=highlight&#038;p=313',0,'highlight','',0),(314,1,'2024-08-13 04:15:07','2024-08-13 04:15:07','','exp-destination (1)','','inherit','open','closed','','exp-destination-1','','','2024-08-13 04:15:07','2024-08-13 04:15:07','',313,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/exp-destination-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(315,1,'2024-08-13 04:19:21','2024-08-13 04:19:21','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With its contemporary design, open-air spaces, and tropical surroundings, guests can relax on sun loungers and enjoy the crystal-clear waters. The club hosts lively parties with renowned DJs, while the on-site restaurant serves international and local cuisine. Amenities like a swimming pool, cabanas, and attentive staff contribute to an unforgettable stay. Atlas Beach Club Bali is the ultimate tropical paradise, combining relaxation, entertainment, and gastronomic delights for a remarkable beachfront experience.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>8,3 Km from Villa Pulang</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Atlas Beach Club','','publish','closed','closed','','atlas-beach-club','','','2024-10-02 04:32:36','2024-10-02 04:32:36','',0,'https://pulangbali.com/?post_type=highlight&#038;p=315',0,'highlight','',0),(316,1,'2024-08-13 04:19:13','2024-08-13 04:19:13','','destination-atlas (2)','','inherit','open','closed','','destination-atlas-2','','','2024-08-13 04:19:13','2024-08-13 04:19:13','',315,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/destination-atlas-2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(317,1,'2024-08-13 04:21:15','2024-08-13 04:21:15','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This charming bakery invites you to experience a delightful gastronomic journey. Step into a cozy and inviting atmosphere where the aroma of freshly baked goods fills the air. From artisanal bread and pastries to delectable cakes and savory treats, Baked Canggu Bali offers a wide array of delectable delights made with the finest ingredients.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>0,2 Km from Villa Pulang</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Baked','','publish','closed','closed','','baked','','','2024-10-02 04:32:01','2024-10-02 04:32:01','',0,'https://pulangbali.com/?post_type=highlight&#038;p=317',0,'highlight','',0),(318,1,'2024-08-13 04:21:03','2024-08-13 04:21:03','','destination-baked (2)','','inherit','open','closed','','destination-baked-2','','','2024-08-13 04:21:03','2024-08-13 04:21:03','',317,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/destination-baked-2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(319,1,'2024-08-13 04:22:56','2024-08-13 04:22:56','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Come and experience the ultimate beachfront getaway at Finns Beach Club. Lounge on sunbeds overlooking the sparkling Indian Ocean, sip on refreshing cocktails, and bask in the tropical ambiance. With its lively poolside parties, renowned DJs, and top-notch service, Finns Beach Club guarantees an unforgettable experience.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>8,2 Km from Villa Pulang</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','FINNS Beach Club','','publish','closed','closed','','finns-beach-club','','','2024-10-02 04:31:07','2024-10-02 04:31:07','',0,'https://pulangbali.com/?post_type=highlight&#038;p=319',0,'highlight','',0),(320,1,'2024-08-13 04:22:43','2024-08-13 04:22:43','','destination-finns (2)','','inherit','open','closed','','destination-finns-2','','','2024-08-13 04:22:43','2024-08-13 04:22:43','',319,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/destination-finns-2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(321,1,'2024-08-13 04:24:37','2024-08-13 04:24:37','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Immerse yourself in an authentic and vibrant dining experience as you savor the finest flavors of Japanese cuisine. From meticulously crafted sushi and sashimi to flavorful ramen and delectable izakaya-style dishes, Indigo Japanese Restaurant offers a diverse menu that caters to all palates. With a dedicated team of skilled chefs and impeccable service, this restaurant promises an unforgettable dining experience that will transport you to the heart of Japan right in the heart of Bali.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>6 Km from Villa Pulang</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Indigo','','publish','closed','closed','','indigo','','','2024-10-02 04:30:18','2024-10-02 04:30:18','',0,'https://pulangbali.com/?post_type=highlight&#038;p=321',0,'highlight','',0),(322,1,'2024-08-13 04:24:20','2024-08-13 04:24:20','','destination-indigo (2)','','inherit','open','closed','','destination-indigo-2','','','2024-08-13 04:24:20','2024-08-13 04:24:20','',321,'https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/destination-indigo-2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(324,1,'2024-08-14 02:58:20','2024-08-14 02:58:20','<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"buttler\">[experiencenew highlight_id=\"304\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"dining\">[experiencenew2 highlight_id=\"306\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"wellness\">[experiencenew highlight_id=\"308\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"activities\">[experiencenew highlight_id=\"310\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->','Experience','','inherit','closed','closed','','32-revision-v1','','','2024-08-14 02:58:20','2024-08-14 02:58:20','',32,'https://pulangbali.com/?p=324',0,'revision','',0),(325,1,'2024-08-14 03:01:22','2024-08-14 03:01:22','<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"buttler\">[experiencenew highlight_id=\"304\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"dining\">[experiencenew2 highlight_id=\"306\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"wellness\">[experiencenew highlight_id=\"309\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"activities\">[experiencenew2 highlight_id=\"311\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->','Experience','','inherit','closed','closed','','32-revision-v1','','','2024-08-14 03:01:22','2024-08-14 03:01:22','',32,'https://pulangbali.com/?p=325',0,'revision','',0),(326,1,'2024-08-14 03:01:57','2024-08-14 03:01:57','<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"buttler\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">[experiencenew highlight_id=\"304\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"dining\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">[experiencenew2 highlight_id=\"306\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"wellness\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">[experiencenew highlight_id=\"309\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n<div id=\"activities\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">[experiencenew2 highlight_id=\"311\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->','Experience','','inherit','closed','closed','','32-revision-v1','','','2024-08-14 03:01:57','2024-08-14 03:01:57','',32,'https://pulangbali.com/?p=326',0,'revision','',0),(327,1,'2024-08-14 08:35:09','2024-08-14 08:35:09','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each villa boasts well-appointed bedrooms with en-suite bathrooms, ensuring privacy and comfort for all guests. The master bedrooms often feature private balconies, perfect for enjoying a morning coffee or evening sunset. The living areas are spacious and inviting, with comfortable seating, modern entertainment systems, and large windows that offer stunning views of the gardens and pool.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Stay','','inherit','closed','closed','','29-revision-v1','','','2024-08-14 08:35:09','2024-08-14 08:35:09','',29,'https://pulangbali.com/?p=327',0,'revision',