<section class=\"mt-60\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">\n    <div class=\"container py-3\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-9\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-blue\">Villa Pulang 2BR</h2>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel\" data-flickity=\"{&quot;contain&quot;: true, &quot;groupCells&quot;: false, &quot;pageDots&quot;: false, &quot;imagesLoaded&quot;: true, &quot;imagesLoaded&quot;: true}\">\n        <img class=\"img-fluid pe-1\" src=\"https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/OUTDOOR-3.jpg\" width=\"660\" alt=\"image of room\">\n        <img class=\"img-fluid pe-1\" src=\"https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/MASTER-BEDROOM2.jpg\" width=\"660\" alt=\"image of room\">\n        <img class=\"img-fluid pe-1\" src=\"https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/MASTER-BEDROOM-1.jpg\" width=\"660\" alt=\"image of room\">\n        <img class=\"img-fluid pe-1\" src=\"https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/LIVING-SPACE-DINING.jpg\" width=\"660\" alt=\"image of room\">\n        <img class=\"img-fluid pe-1\" src=\"https://pulangbali.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/KITCHEN-DINING-LIVING-SPACE.jpg\" width=\"660\" alt=\"image of room\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container py-5\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 order-lg-2 ps-md-5\">                \n                <h3 class=\"text-blue\">The Property</h3>\n                <p>The two bedroom villas have an enclosed living room, kitchen and dining areas. You will also enjoy a swimming pool and pool deck just next to the dining area. Upstairs you will find an informal, getaway lounge, and the two bedrooms.</p>\n                <a class=\"btn btn-outline-red rounded-0 d-none d-lg-inline-block\" href=\"/room/pulang-villas-2br/\">See more</a>    \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 order-lg-1\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-blue facilities\"><span>Facilities</